{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚播出的熱播劇集《玫瑰戰爭》迎來首波高潮，劇中傅嘉莉為報復私怨藉著拍攝戲中戲機會連環狂摑陳自瑤。這場震撼觀眾 …</p><p></p>\n<p>昨晚播出的熱播劇集《玫瑰戰爭》迎來首波高潮，劇中傅嘉莉為報復私怨藉著拍攝戲中戲機會連環狂摑陳自瑤。這場震撼觀眾眼球掌摑戲碼不但引發極大迴響，更令女主角面頰出現明顯紅腫。這段長達數分鐘激烈肢體衝突背後隱藏著劇組內部鮮為人知駭人內幕。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉《玫瑰戰爭》連環掌摑陳自瑤面頰紅腫</h2>\n<p>在12日晚播出的第4集劇情交代暗戀馬國明飾演德龍多時的角色菲雅，得悉對方與關子盈陷入熱戀後妒火中燒，竟然趁著合作拍攝戲中戲期間公報私仇。畫面上傅嘉莉對著陳自瑤毫不留情地連摑10多巴，隨後兩人更上演互扯頭髮與反摑激烈扭打戲碼。由於事前雙方已經達成真打共識，拍攝過程毫不借位，直接導致陳自瑤被狂摑後當場面頰呈現嚴重紅腫狀態。</p>\n<h2>總監製鍾澍佳直認誤會《玫瑰戰爭》兩位演員不和</h2>\n<p>面對這場極度逼真掌摑戲碼，就連擔任總監製鍾澍佳亦一度被蒙在鼓裡。他在受訪時坦言最初觀看拍攝片段時受到極大衝擊，直指自己當下以為陳自瑤與傅嘉莉在現實中存在私怨。鍾澍佳憶述當時情況指：「我初初睇片，以為陳自瑤同傅嘉莉真係唔啱、或者有咩私怨，因為吓吓都打到好真！後尾睇番花絮，見到佢哋笑晒口完全冇嘢，證明佢哋真係演得好好，呃晒我！」</p>\n<h2>陳自瑤傅嘉莉為求逼真硬食對方重擊拒絕借位</h2>\n<p>為了將劇中這場重頭戲呈現到極致，負責動手傅嘉莉事前承受著極大心理壓力，她為免刮傷對方面部特意剪短指甲並除下所有首飾。陳自瑤受訪時重申面部紅腫全屬真實而非化妝效果，她強調：「借位會變咗好假，所以我非常同意真打。拍之前我仲同Kelly講：『你唔使驚，你狠狠地摑落嚟啦！』」傅嘉莉亦坦言奉行寧願硬受一次重擊都不想重拍數次原則，拍攝特寫鏡頭時必須展現出肌肉震動真實感。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚《玫瑰戰爭》女人戲精彩賜封兜巴瑤</h2>\n<p>這場火花四濺對手戲播出後迅速在網絡上掀起熱烈討論，不少觀眾對於兩位女演員放下身段真打上陣感到震撼。大批網民湧入社交平台留言表達觀後感，紛紛為陳自瑤改下全新稱號「兜巴瑤」，以形容她在劇中硬食連環巴掌慘況。大量留言關注二人表現，當中有網民表示：「這台女人戲好精彩」，亦有觀眾留言指出：「看起來好真，看著就很痛」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175408183678_17188649196af6d6da80fde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"08a.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175408183678_17188649196af6d6da80fde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175581288515_19077250996af6d6dc4d63a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"08.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175581288515_19077250996af6d6dc4d63a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175834295452_10616946386af6d6dead1ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"10.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175834295452_10616946386af6d6dead1ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175994651413_3635154066af6d6e03e1ea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"06.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456175994651413_3635154066af6d6e03e1ea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176165343608_21288595286af6d6e210f22.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"13.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176165343608_21288595286af6d6e210f22.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176386975851_2123056566af6d6e43470f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"28.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176386975851_2123056566af6d6e43470f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176572715885_12914601436af6d6e62326b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"27.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179456176572715885_12914601436af6d6e62326b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%82%85%e5%98%89%e8%8e%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">傅嘉莉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%87%aa%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳自瑤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542209\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.137264+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1309,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:22:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:55.073574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:55.073574+00:00","content_hash":"c4b469c56e4498ea94e6923aee60b923674c8d61553d47ecf72b9eb81fc372a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}